        "title": "Hide ring when disabled",
        "user": {
          "login": "hampuskraft",
          "id": 24176136,
          "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI0MTc2MTM2",
          "gravatar_id": "",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/users/hampuskraft",
          "type": "User",
          "site_admin": false
        },
        "body": "Hi there,\r\n\r\nWhen the `enabled` prop in `<FocusRing enabled={isKeyboardMode} />` changes from `true` to `false`, the ring [remains visible](https://codesandbox.io/s/loving-galileo-ogu85?file=/src/index.tsx). However, this is not the case in the Discord app, so I'm not sure if I'm doing something wrong here. Regardless, this resolves the issue for me. Let me know if I should do something differently!\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\nKind regards,\r\nHampus Kraft.",
        "created_at": "2021-06-03T06:14:43Z",
        "updated_at": "2021-10-08T18:53:41Z",
